+
+    The workspace context is installed explicitly because binding requests may
+    carry the target workspace in the JSON body rather than in the request
+    header. Any validation or persistence failure is handled by the caller so
+    a successful binding is never rolled back by collection startup.
+    """
+    return _start_automatic_run(source_id, workspace_id, "binding")
